---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import ServiceSchema from '../../components/schema/Service.astro';
import FaqAccordion from '../../components/FaqAccordion.astro';
import CtaBanner from '../../components/CtaBanner.astro';
import { Picture } from 'astro:assets';
import officeRefurbImg from '../../assets/images/office-refurbishment.jpg';

const faqs = [
  {
    question: 'What\'s the Difference Between an Office Fit Out and an Office Refurbishment?',
    answer: 'A fit out typically applies to an empty or shell space being fitted out for the first time, while a refurbishment updates or reconfigures an existing, already-fitted space. Many projects blend both, and A2 delivers either under the same fixed-price, in-house model, so you only ever deal with one accountable team.',
  },
  {
    question: 'Can You Refurbish an Office While It\'s Still Occupied?',
    answer: 'Yes. Out-of-hours and phased working are how we handle most occupied refurbishments, scheduling disruptive works for evenings, weekends, or agreed downtime. This approach lets your team keep working normally throughout the project, with noisy or dusty tasks planned around your business hours rather than during them.',
  },
  {
    question: 'How Much Does an Office Refurbishment Cost?',
    answer: 'Cost depends on the scope, the condition of the existing space, and how much M&E or structural work is involved. We provide a fixed-price quote after a site survey, so the number you agree to is the number you pay, regardless of what we uncover once work gets underway.',
  },
  {
    question: 'How Long Does an Office Refurbishment Take?',
    answer: 'Smaller refurbishments can be completed in a matter of weeks; larger or phased projects take longer. Our in-house trades and out-of-hours capability are built to keep programmes as short as the scope allows, and we\'ll give you a realistic timeline before you commit to anything, not an optimistic guess.',
  },
  {
    question: 'Do You Handle EPC and Compliance Improvements As Part of a Refurbishment?',
    answer: 'Yes, refurbishment is often the most cost-effective point to improve EPC ratings, fire safety and accessibility compliance, and we build these into the scope where relevant. Raising an office\'s EPC rating during a wider refurbishment avoids paying for separate works later and can add real value to the property.',
  },
];
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Office Refurbishment Company | Fixed-Price Refurbishments"
  description="Office refurbishment contractors delivering fixed-price refurbishments across London & the South East, with in-house trades and out-of-hours working."
>
  <div class="container">
    <Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'Services', href: '/services' }, { label: 'Office Refurbishment' }]} />
  </div>

  <section class="section--tight bg-white">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Office Refurbishment Companies Rely On for Fast, Fixed-Price Work</h1>
      <p>A2 Commercial Fit Out is an <strong>office refurbishment contractor</strong> delivering fixed-price refurbishments across London, Kent and Essex. Whether you're refreshing tired finishes, reconfiguring layouts for hybrid working, or bringing an older building up to current standards, we deliver the work with our own in-house trades and a fixed price agreed before we start.</p>
      <p>Office refurbishment is often more disruptive than a full fit out, because your team is usually still working around it. That's exactly where our out-of-hours model earns its keep: evenings, weekends, or phased working, so your business doesn't have to stop.</p>

      <Picture src={officeRefurbImg} alt="" width={1200} height={800} widths={[400, 800, 1200]} sizes="(min-width: 48rem) 50vw, 100vw" formats={['avif', 'webp']} fallbackFormat="jpg" loading="lazy" />

      <h2>What's Included in an Office Refurbishment</h2>
      <p>Commercial office refurbishment can range from a cosmetic refresh to a full reconfiguration. Common scope includes:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Redecoration, flooring and ceiling replacement</li>
        <li>Partition removal or reconfiguration</li>
        <li>Kitchen, breakout and meeting space upgrades</li>
        <li>M&E upgrades, including lighting and controls</li>
        <li>Compliance improvements: fire safety, accessibility, Building Regulations</li>
        <li>EPC and energy efficiency improvements</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Our Office Refurbishment Process</h2>
      <ol>
        <li><strong>Site survey and scope.</strong> We assess the existing space and confirm what's changing.</li>
        <li><strong>Fixed-price quote.</strong> One clear price for the full scope, agreed before work starts.</li>
        <li><strong>Phased or out-of-hours programme.</strong> We plan the works around your operating hours wherever the building stays occupied.</li>
        <li><strong>In-house delivery.</strong> Our own trades carry out the refurbishment, keeping quality and programme under direct control.</li>
        <li><strong>Minimal disruption handover.</strong> Each phase is signed off and handed back cleanly before the next begins.</li>
      </ol>

      <h2>Why Choose A2 for Office Refurbishment</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Fixed-price quotes</strong>, so refurbishment budgets don't move once work is underway.</li>
        <li><strong>In-house trades</strong>, giving direct control over quality and pace rather than relying on a subcontractor chain.</li>
        <li><strong>Out-of-hours working</strong>, built specifically for refurbishing occupied space without disrupting your team.</li>
        <li><strong>Fast turnaround</strong>, so your business spends less time working around scaffolding and dust sheets.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Refurbishment Work Across London, Kent and Essex</h2>
      <p>Searches for office refurbishment companies near me are among the fastest-growing search terms in this space, and it's easy to see why: refurbishment work benefits from a contractor who can be on site quickly and communicate clearly throughout. A2 is based in Maidstone, Kent, and delivers refurbishment projects across London, Kent and Essex.</p>

      <FaqAccordion items={faqs} />

      <p class="related-links">Related: <a href="/services/office-fit-out">Office Fit Out</a> · <a href="/services/landlord-refurbishment">Landlord Refurbishment</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CtaBanner heading="Considering an Office Refurbishment?" body="Tell us what's changing about how your business works and we'll put together a fixed-price scope." />

  <ServiceSchema name="Office Refurbishment" description="Commercial office refurbishment delivered to a fixed price by in-house trades across London, Kent, Essex and the South East." url="/services/office-refurbishment" />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .related-links { font-size: var(--step--1); color: var(--text-on-light-muted); margin-top: var(--space-md); }
</style>
